forumulate:index/collection:Collection.description:
A collection: the container a docs space groups its pages into, and the navigation tree readers see. Collections nest (<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`parentId`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ParentId`" pulumi-lang-go="`parentId`" pulumi-lang-python="`parent_id`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`parentId`" pulumi-lang-java="`parentId`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`parent_id`">`parentId`</span>), carry a landing page (<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`description`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Description`" pulumi-lang-go="`description`" pulumi-lang-python="`description`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`description`" pulumi-lang-java="`description`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`description`">`description`</span>, <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`coverUrl`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`CoverUrl`" pulumi-lang-go="`coverUrl`" pulumi-lang-python="`cover_url`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`coverUrl`" pulumi-lang-java="`coverUrl`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`cover_url`">`coverUrl`</span>, <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`seo`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Seo`" pulumi-lang-go="`seo`" pulumi-lang-python="`seo`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`seo`" pulumi-lang-java="`seo`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`seo`">`seo`</span>) and decide how the sidebar treats them (<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`nav`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Nav`" pulumi-lang-go="`nav`" pulumi-lang-python="`nav`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`nav`" pulumi-lang-java="`nav`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`nav`">`nav`</span>).

## Example Usage

<!--Start PulumiCodeChooser -->
```typescript
import * as pulumi from "@pulumi/pulumi";
import * as forumulate from "@forumulate/pulumi";

const guides = new forumulate.Collection("guides", {
    spaceId: docs.id,
    name: "Guides",
    slug: "guides",
    description: "Start here.",
    nav: {
        icon: "book",
        collapsed: false,
        hubCards: true,
    },
    seo: {
        title: "Guides",
        index: "index",
    },
    translations: {
        es: {
            name: "Guías",
            description: "Empieza aquí.",
        },
    },
});
const api = new forumulate.Collection("api", {
    spaceId: docs.id,
    name: "API",
    parentId: guides.id,
});
