forumulate:index/domain:Domain.description:
A custom hostname for a space or a whole site. Creating one claims the name and returns the DNS records to publish (<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dnsTarget`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DnsTarget`" pulumi-lang-go="`dnsTarget`" pulumi-lang-python="`dns_target`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dnsTarget`" pulumi-lang-java="`dnsTarget`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`dns_target`">`dnsTarget`</span>, <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`verificationRecord`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`VerificationRecord`" pulumi-lang-go="`verificationRecord`" pulumi-lang-python="`verification_record`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`verificationRecord`" pulumi-lang-java="`verificationRecord`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`verification_record`">`verificationRecord`</span>: feed them to your DNS provider's resource). Nothing is served at the name until it is verified and activated: set `activate = true` once the records exist and the next apply verifies and switches traffic over (apply again after DNS propagates if the first attempt warns).

Exactly one of <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`spaceId`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`SpaceId`" pulumi-lang-go="`spaceId`" pulumi-lang-python="`space_id`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`spaceId`" pulumi-lang-java="`spaceId`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`space_id`">`spaceId`</span> or <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`siteId`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`SiteId`" pulumi-lang-go="`siteId`" pulumi-lang-python="`site_id`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`siteId`" pulumi-lang-java="`siteId`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`site_id`">`siteId`</span> is required. <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`redirectTo`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`RedirectTo`" pulumi-lang-go="`redirectTo`" pulumi-lang-python="`redirect_to`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`redirectTo`" pulumi-lang-java="`redirectTo`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`redirect_to`">`redirectTo`</span> and <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`ipAllowList`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`IpAllowList`" pulumi-lang-go="`ipAllowList`" pulumi-lang-python="`ip_allow_list`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`ipAllowList`" pulumi-lang-java="`ipAllowList`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`ip_allow_list`">`ipAllowList`</span> exist on a space's domain only.

## Example Usage

<!--Start PulumiCodeChooser -->
```typescript
import * as pulumi from "@pulumi/pulumi";
import * as forumulate from "@forumulate/pulumi";

const docs = new forumulate.Domain("docs", {
    spaceId: docsForumulateSpace.id,
    hostname: "docs.example.com",
    alsoRedirectWww: false,
    activate: true,
});
export const docsDnsTarget = docs.dnsTarget;
export const docsDnsVerification = docs.verificationRecord;
// A whole site behind one name.
const site = new forumulate.Domain("site", {
    siteId: main.id,
    hostname: "www.example.com",
});
// Retire an old name by redirecting it.
const legacy = new forumulate.Domain("legacy", {
    spaceId: docsForumulateSpace.id,
    hostname: "old-docs.example.com",
    redirectTo: "https://docs.example.com",
});
// Docs only reachable from the office network.
const internal = new forumulate.Domain("internal", {
    spaceId: internalForumulateSpace.id,
    hostname: "internal.example.com",
    ipAllowLists: ["203.0.113.0/24"],
});
```
