A category of a forum space: its look (colours, icon, logo), who may post and how (approval, slow mode, tags, templates), its defaults for readers, and its names in other languages. Destroying a category is refused by the API while it holds topics; set <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`deleteMoveTopicsTo`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DeleteMoveTopicsTo`" pulumi-lang-go="`deleteMoveTopicsTo`" pulumi-lang-python="`delete_move_topics_to`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`deleteMoveTopicsTo`" pulumi-lang-java="`deleteMoveTopicsTo`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`delete_move_topics_to`">`deleteMoveTopicsTo`</span> (they move there) or <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`deleteForce`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DeleteForce`" pulumi-lang-go="`deleteForce`" pulumi-lang-python="`delete_force`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`deleteForce`" pulumi-lang-java="`deleteForce`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`delete_force`">`deleteForce`</span> (they are left uncategorised). The topics themselves are never deleted.

