mi-lang-nodejs="`statusSettingsJson`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`StatusSettingsJson`" pulumi-lang-go="`statusSettingsJson`" pulumi-lang-python="`status_settings_json`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`statusSettingsJson`" pulumi-lang-java="`statusSettingsJson`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`status_settings_json`">`statusSettingsJson`</span>). Each part is optional and only the parts you declare are managed.

